.TH d2b 1 1970-01-01 "d2b 0.0.0-bootstrap" "d2b CLI"
.SH NAME
d2b \- Typed Zone resource client for d2b.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBd2b\fR [\fB\-\-zone\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-human\fR] [\fB\-\-deadline\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-deadline\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Typed Zone resource client for d2b.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-zone\fR \fI<ZONE>\fR
Address a declared Zone. Without this flag the nearest local runtime is selected
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the stable JSON envelope
.TP
\fB\-\-human\fR
Force human\-readable terminal output
.TP
\fB\-\-deadline\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR
Bound all Zone requests and streams
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-deadline\fR
Suppress the command default deadline
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
